{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53990","headline":"卜山居 · 温庭筠","name":"卜山居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山底采薇云不厌，洞中栽树鹤先知。\n（见《日本古典文学大系》七三册藤原公任《和汉朗咏集》卷下《仙家》引）（按：上毛河世宁《全唐诗逸》卷中收二句归「温达」。\n川口久雄注《和汉朗咏集》以爲系沿袭《千唐佳句》抄本的误字而致误。\n题从架藏私注本。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53990.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53990","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}